{
  "schema_version": 1,
  "manifest_id": "operations.purchase_order_three_way_match-batch05",
  "revision": "luna_batch05_public_v1",
  "public_request": "Perform a three-way match on our procurement data. We have three worksheets in ss_procurement:\n\n1. ws_po - Purchase Orders: PO Number, Vendor, Item, Qty Ordered, Unit Price, PO Date\n2. ws_inv - Invoices: Invoice Number, PO Number, Invoice Amount, Invoice Date\n3. ws_recv - Receiving: Receipt ID, PO Number, Qty Received, Receipt Date, Notes\n\nMatch records by PO Number. Flag discrepancies where:\n- Qty Received != Qty Ordered (UNLESS the Notes column says 'Partial - Expected')\n- Invoice Amount != (Qty Ordered * Unit Price)\n\nCreate a Monday item on board 'Procurement Issues' for each discrepancy with details. Email procurement@supplychainco.com with a summary of all mismatches.\n\nOnly match POs from January 2026 or later (PO Date >= 2026-01-01). Older POs have already been reconciled.",
  "bindings": [
    {
      "path": [
        "task_evidence",
        "prompt",
        0,
        "content"
      ],
      "canonical_sha256": "759946c505d4cd1ae5229c2caa09ce98f7cf8afebff2ee3f66c8e10cf3745b23"
    },
    {
      "path": [
